FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://127.0.0.1:8088/api/v1

# RAVEN Demo Shop API (API Blueprint)

A small practice API that ships with RAVEN. Start it with `raven demo`.

## Health [/health]

### Health check [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {"status": "ok"}

## Products [/products{?category,limit}]

+ Parameters
    + category: books (string, optional) - Product category
    + limit: 10 (number, optional) - How many products to return

### List products [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
+ Response 400 (application/json)

## Users [/users]

### List users [GET]

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer demo-token

+ Response 200 (application/json)

## User [/users/{id}]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - The user ID

### Get one user [GET]

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer demo-token

+ Response 200 (application/json)
+ Response 404 (application/json)

## Orders [/orders]

### List orders [GET]

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer demo-token

+ Response 200 (application/json)

### Create an order [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer demo-token

    + Body

            {"product_id": 7, "quantity": 1}

+ Response 201 (application/json)

## Login [/login]

### Log in [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {"username": "demo", "password": "demo-password"}

+ Response 200 (application/json)

## Daily report [/reports/daily]

### Get the daily report [GET]

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer demo-token

+ Response 200 (application/json)
